  "full_chain_findings": {
    "registered_actor_and_access": "Actual SEAL registry is CREATURE, NO_RESTRICTIONS placement invokes concrete canSealSpawn: frozen/deep frozen ocean uses ice+brightness>8; other biomes tag substrate+brightness>8. This is a placement predicate only, not native spawn opportunity/cap/biome population proof. Species climate finalization sets Arctic/variant and air. Native resource tags not locally available.",
    "payment_entry": "No own mobInteract implementation. Own dropped-item target accepts offerings OR breedables. Existing complete CreatureAITargetItems/ITargetsDroppedItems callback-before-one-shrink chain is reused via Crow record, not newly read/counted. OnGetItem offerings increments persistent fishFeedings, EAT/CAT_EAT; at>=3, only currently resolving ItemEntity.getOwner (native thrower entity, not pickup target or necessarily Player) overwrites feederUUID, then count resets0 even absent thrower. Non-offering branch clears feederUUID; all accepted callback items heal10. No own baby/creative/feeder-null/server guard. Third payer receives service identity even if first two were others; absent third thrower preserves old feederUUID.",
    "eligibility_and_scheduler": "Dive goal priority6, constructor sets no flags. Reused exact native Goal/GoalSelector/WrappedGoal empty flag set means it does not reserve MOVE/JUMP/LOOK, not priority exclusivity. canUse only checks feederUUID resolves in current level player list and revengeCooldown<=0, then samples location; no fishFeedings>=3, adult, empty-hand, target or lastHurt check there. Native EntityGetter UUID loop has no alive/spectator test. canContinue checks no target/revenge/lastHurt, cached thrower nonnull, feederUUID nonnull, digPos and water above. It does not re-resolve player, alive/dimension/UUID equality; water condition applies also during return.",
    "location_and_count": "Water actor:15 random x/z offsets in[-7,7], descend while water and y>1 to tagged dig substrate. Land actor:15 water probes starting y+3 descend through empty space; each successful water probe may start independent15 seafloor search, so nested bounded sampling not225 references or guaranteed reachable substrate. Initial seafloor selection does not itself require water above; continuation does. Dig counts only evaluated close distanceSquared<2 updates, persists across moving away within same goal; no requiresUpdateEveryTick override. >=100 cumulative close evaluations, not100worldticks, asks named gameplay seal_reward loot with only THIS_ENTITY under PIGLIN_BARTER.",
    "loot_and_handoff": "Reused actual LootDataManager/Resolver/Params/Table/ForgeHooks boundaries: missing table resolves empty, params require THIS_ENTITY/default luck and global modifiers possible. Raw exact loot content absent. Nonempty list: first stack copy replaces current main hand without prior hand reconciliation; remaining stack copies spawn unchecked. Return flagtrue; empty loot resets digTime0 but leaves entitlement and retry enabled with no own cap. dig feedback false each100; intermediate true and periodic substrate hit sound, not player reward receipt.",
    "return_and_stop": "Return moves cached Player until distance<2. Copies hand then clears hand BEFORE nullable spawnAtLocation, optionally velocity toward player, clears feederUUID and stop regardless of spawn or pickup. Native spawn helper only returns an object after capture/unchecked add, no admission guarantee. It sets no pickup target/owner or exact same ItemEntityUUID player receipt. Native playerTouch separately requires delay/target/Forge gate/inventory insertion. stop clears goal-local state,digTime,return flag and fishFeedings, drops nonempty hand unchecked+clears it but does NOT clear feederUUID. Interrupted retained entitlement can retry; not lossless escrow or guaranteed once payout.",
    "persistence": "Own save/read persists FishFeedings/optional FeederUUID plus Arctic/Basking/baskingTimer/swimTimer/Variant. Missing FeederUUID does not clear same-object old field; fresh object defaultnull. Own data does not save revenge,Digging,goal digPos/cached Player/digTime/returnToPlayer. Actual native Mob whole additional writer365..439/reader441..499 serializes handItems independently. Fresh loaded entity may retain hand reward+feeder but new goal starts dig rather than resume return, and first new loot can overwrite hand; this is a conditional static boundary, no exploit/native restart tested. Read on reused goal object is distinct and no goal reset claim.",
